      "lines": [
        "§4. 乘法和除法"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "27. 乘法"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题1.某工厂一天生产200套男服.改作新式服装后，",
        "每套服装的用料变化了0.4平方米.每天生产的男服用料变",
        "化了多少？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "每套男服的用料增加了0.4平方米.所以解这道题应该",
        "是0.4乘以200：",
        "$0.4\\cdot200=80$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "就是说，每天生产的男服用料增加了80平方米.换句话说，",
        "变化了80平方米."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题2.某工厂一天生产200套男服.改作新式服装后，",
        "每套男服用料变化了$-0.4$平方米.每天生产的男服用料变",
        "化了多少？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "每套男服的用料减少0.4平方米.所以一天生产的男服",
        "用料减少了$0.4\\cdot200=80$（平方米）.结果一天生产的男服用",
        "料变化了$-80$平方米.就是说，$-0.4$和200的积等于$-80$：",
        "$(-0.4)\\cdot200=-80$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "积$(-0.4)\\cdot200$和$0.4\\cdot200$的区别在于第一个因数的符号不",
        "同.乘得结果："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "108"
      ]
    }
  ]
